      "exhibit": "C-3",
      "page": 7,
      "text": "Later, Meilin Guo made a detailed instruction on the collection of the awards. He mentioned that the 9th Blue Lantern Award altogether received more than 3,200 case works of various categories (with a year- on- year growth of 22\\% ) from more than 640 participating companies (with a year- on- year growth of 17\\% ). Over 50\\% 's participating companies were selected out for final review upon online review, to be specific, 416 companies. As to the whole case works, more than 1,000 works were selected out for final review, with the proportion of finalists of case works not higher than 27.5\\% of the total cases.",
